                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                        "entry_id": "38749c44-682f-374d-b44e-2ff36bc93271",
                        "glosses": [
                            "женское имя древнегерманского происхождения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d03317e0-e31d-4dd1-80ff-b75e540a2693",
                                "sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                                "text": "Но я вспомнил, что он отец Аделины, и с учтивостию сказал ему, что он видит пред собою русских дворян, желающих посещать его лекции."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "49c2f97b-0a14-42d7-852f-129dc362331f",
                        "source_entry_id": "38749c44-682f-374d-b44e-2ff36bc93271",
                        "source_sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Adeline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Adeline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d002e658-92e0-3a47-9107-7c82099e6a96",
                                        "entry_id": "894dbc67-3e48-3044-933e-966a63f1e267",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from the Germanic languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25c55cb9-394a-4d8f-a25c-16dd3609c8f2",
                                                "sense_id": "d002e658-92e0-3a47-9107-7c82099e6a96",
                                                "text": "\"That's my own corner...In it I have always called you Adeline.\" \"Please don't say Adelyne. I am accustomed to Adeleen.\" \"I suppose that's why I pronounce it Adelyne.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ebec0bf2-e144-4fea-bf9c-87c481a87aba",
                        "source_entry_id": "38749c44-682f-374d-b44e-2ff36bc93271",
                        "source_sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Adeline",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e5e28d9a-4fc2-4d7e-90d3-17e41f88b4a7",
                        "source_entry_id": "38749c44-682f-374d-b44e-2ff36bc93271",
                        "source_sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Adeline",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Adeline",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68bcd9cb-e9be-3c89-ad90-9e9345b3cd38",
                                        "entry_id": "9d4d68a2-7d2c-3964-a95f-d131f2dc3199",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83ed4840-0f4d-4665-a393-2d49a9d1eb81",
                                                "sense_id": "68bcd9cb-e9be-3c89-ad90-9e9345b3cd38",
                                                "text": "Christiane Adeline, née Seillier, et Jacques Adeline, gardent en mémoire les événements de la Seconde Guerre mondiale, que l'une a vécus à Cabourg, l'autre à Dives-sur-Mer et Auberville."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Adeline",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63afaa5e-89e5-3da2-a5f9-2621c3f9ef3e",
                                        "entry_id": "d26919ec-c9d7-395f-adbc-68c536f14af3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04aa28df-4a8c-4a5c-b8d4-ee0fbd5f8257",
                                                "sense_id": "63afaa5e-89e5-3da2-a5f9-2621c3f9ef3e",
                                                "text": "Adeline obtenait à force de larmes qu’il avalât des bouillons ; elle le gardait, assise à son chevet, et ne sentant plus, de tous les sentiments qui naguère lui remplissaient le cœur, qu’une pitié profonde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fd15ffd-3fd8-4460-ac6c-cde9e5e5e5e7",
                                                "sense_id": "63afaa5e-89e5-3da2-a5f9-2621c3f9ef3e",
                                                "text": "Avec Marianne Chaillan, pour À la folie, passionnément !, Tahar Ben Jelloun, pour Les Amants de Casablanca, Jacques Weber, pour On ne dit jamais assez aux gens qu’on les aime, Adeline Dieudonné, pour Rest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b86d367-5646-4dad-93ba-95ff6a627a94",
                                                "sense_id": "63afaa5e-89e5-3da2-a5f9-2621c3f9ef3e",
                                                "text": "« Le phénomène a émergé voilà un quart de siècle dans notre pays », nous explique Adeline Lenoir, directrice et fondatrice de cette agence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46ea6035-38a7-4c30-a875-51d6c4d7366a",
                        "source_entry_id": "38749c44-682f-374d-b44e-2ff36bc93271",
                        "source_sense_id": "44664779-a25d-3420-b68a-2abe58a79825",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Aline",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Aline",
